From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ninjacornix <milanvrankic@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:45:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(editor): add tool rail and bottom utilities

Joinery-only, not for upstream: center run controls and move workspace selectors into an icon rail. Keep the rail outside dock split accounting so saved dock widths retain their meaning.

Migrate existing utility docks to the bottom once, preserving unrelated docks, closed panels and floating-window settings. Later manual layouts remain intact.
